'''''Star Wars: Maul - Shadow Lord'' Season 2''' is the upcoming second season of ''[[Star Wars: Maul - Shadow Lord]]''. The series continuation was announced by creator and executive director [[Dave Filoni]] via [[StarWars.com]] on [[April 2]], [[2026]], just days before the first episodes of [[Maul - Shadow Lord Season 1|''Maul - Shadow Lord'' Season 1]] premiered on [[April 6]].<ref name="Announcement" /> In an interview on [[April 30]], 2026, [[Sam Witwer]], who voices [[Maul]], shared that, though he couldn't share his knowledge of when the second season would release, fans wouldn't have to wait "too, too long," as the season had already been worked on "for a while," and was following the "usual development cycle."<ref name="thedirect interview">{{WebCite|url=https://thedirect.com/article/maul-shadow-lord-season-2-release-disney-plus-sam-witwer|text=Maul: Shadow Lord Season 2's Release Will Not Take 'Too, Too Long,' Says Sam Witwer - Future Episodes of Disney+ Series Present 'Pressure' and 'Responsibility' Challenges (Exclusive)|author=Sam Hargrave|date=2026-04-20|archivedate=20260503042209}}</ref>

During [[Wikipedia:D23 (Disney)|D23]], [[Matt Michnovetz]] confirmed the season would release in [[2027]].<ref name="D23" />

